commits.message:
[NVIDIA] Use redux for 64-bit bitwise reductions (#11813)

Lower full-warp 64-bit integer AND, OR, and XOR reductions using two
32-bit `redux.sync` operations. Reduce the high and low words
independently, then combine the results.

Idea (XOR):
```cpp
high = uint32_t(x >> 32);
low  = uint32_t(x);

high = redux_xor(high);
low  = redux_xor(low);

result = (uint64_t(high) << 32) | low;
```

